          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "And, of course, we care about you -- our"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          627.9628200904392,
          120.84942141577062,
          21.544837855297203
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "shareholders."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.05896863799282,
          627.9628200904392,
          765.5217092293908,
          21.544837855297203
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Every year we adopt a theme that captures our Company and our values. Our theme"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          646.5024612403101,
          505.87006854838717,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "for 2005 is “Republic Services…A Company that cares”."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          675.5305009689923,
          901.6262974910394,
          21.544837855297146
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our 13,400 dedicated people worked hard last year to create real value. We improved the way we"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          694.070142118863,
          901.5879610215054,
          21.544851098191202
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "deliver our services, increasing our efficiency in routing our collection trucks. We improved the way"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          712.6097965116279,
          901.7232867383514,
          21.54486434108526
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "we construct disposal cells at numerous landfills, lowering costs. We worked with our vendors to"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          731.1494376614987,
          901.7577105734767,
          21.54489082687337
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "control prices. And, we communicated to our customers the value of the services we offer. This year"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          749.6891052971575,
          690.0056424731183,
          21.544864341085287
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "will be no different. We will continue to concentrate on these fundamentals. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          778.7171450258397,
          901.8163449820789,
          21.544864341085287
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Republic’s future is bright. We are mindful of our mission. We know our business exists to ease the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          797.2567994186046,
          901.4501738351255,
          21.54485109819123
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "burden of managing society’s waste. It’s not a glamorous business, but it is an essential one, and we"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          815.7964405684754,
          338.9765927419355,
          21.544864341085287
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "take this responsibility very seriously."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          844.8244802971576,
          901.50711827957,
          21.54486434108526
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "At the end of the year, Republic had 140 collection companies, 58 landfills, 96 transfer stations and 35"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          863.3641346899225,
          901.401513888889,
          21.54485109819123
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "recycling facilities in 22 states. These resources give us many opportunities to listen to our customers,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          881.9037758397933,
          901.6968167562725,
          21.544861692506444
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "anticipate their needs and quickly respond to them. Each customer faces challenges unique to his or"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          900.4434236111111,
          274.81429301075275,
          21.5448709625323
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "her business and community."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          355.73536111111116,
          900.4434236111111,
          606.9504802867383,
          21.5448709625323
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Our goal is to remain flexible and to tailor our services to each"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
          918.9830819767442,
          86.36487983870967,
          21.5448709625323
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/AAAAAO+Palatino-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "customer."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          60.996868279569895,
